  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【2026】黒川温泉といえばコレ！入湯手形露天風呂めぐり・田の原川・馬刺しあか牛＆黒川名門旅館比較</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 via-amber-50/40 to-stone-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-emerald-950 flex items-center gap-2\">♨️ 杉の木札「入湯手形」で楽しむ露天風呂めぐり！霜降り馬刺しと阿蘇あか牛</h3>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">阿蘇の山あいに佇む全国屈指の人気温泉郷・黒川温泉。「街全体が一軒の宿」というコンセプトのもと、木製の「入湯手形」を首から下げて30軒の旅館の個性あふれる露天風呂を湯めぐり。甘みのある「極上馬刺し」、赤身の旨味が凝縮した「肥後あか牛」。渓流のせせらぎとともに癒やしの時間を過ごせます。</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🏆 黒川温泉を代表する最高峰名旅館</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第1位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">黒川温泉　歴史の宿　御客屋</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.91</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/80591/80591.jpg\" alt=\"黒川温泉　歴史の宿　御客屋 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 創業三百年・黒川温泉最古の歴史を誇る老舗宿！田の原川沿いの風情と極上馬刺し会席</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">温泉街の中心に佇む名旅館。混浴露天風呂「里の湯」や代官の湯など多彩な湯舟、囲炉裏端で味わう霜降り馬刺しや肥後あか牛会席が絶賛。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>ご夫婦、カップル、歴史ある黒川温泉の風情と名湯を楽しみたい人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>黒川温泉最古の歴史と極上馬刺し・あか牛会席なら迷わずここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D80591\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】黒川温泉　歴史の宿　御客屋 の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第2位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">黒川温泉　黒川荘</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.76</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/56843/56843.jpg\" alt=\"黒川温泉　黒川荘 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ びょうぶ岩を望む絶景大露天風呂！竹林に囲まれた黒川温泉の隠れ家名宿</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">エメラルドグリーンの川沿いに建つ宿。びょうぶ岩をライトアップした幻想的な露天風呂や、自家源泉の掛け流し温泉、熊本の郷土会席が人気。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>温泉通、カップル、大自然の静寂に癒やされたい人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>びょうぶ岩を望む絶景露天風呂と静寂の自然ならここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D56843\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】黒川温泉　黒川荘 の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>"
